The MIT License above covers only the source code in this repository
(*.py files) and the documentation written for it.

The exam questions, answer options, correct answers and illustrations
(data/questions.json, data/images/ and any Anki deck built from them) are
taken from the official exam base of the Main Service Center of the Ministry
of Internal Affairs of Ukraine (ГСЦ МВС, hsc.gov.ua), order No. 225 of
29.10.2025. They are included, unmodified in substance, for exam preparation.
They are not covered by this license; all rights belong to their owner.
The original PDF files are not distributed here; download them from
hsc.gov.ua.

Answers were cross-checked against https://github.com/Brut322/pdr-test
(MIT License). No guarantee is given that every answer is correct; verify
against the official source.
